recipe_name = "Forge Bonebreaker Plate"
description = "Hammer the sky-iron plates over a bog-iron mail backing. Heavy work for the smith, heavier for the wearer. The first man to wear this set killed three trolls with a hammer, then walked into the sea. Either part may be apocryphal."
